message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Beyond the Squeaky Wheel: A Multi-City Comparative Analysis of Differentiated Engagement and Demographic Equity in 311 Reporting Gaps"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Claire
    family-names: Feeney
    affiliation: "University College London"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/[your-orcid-if-you-have-one]"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline for non-emergency 311 service request data across
  18 US cities, including keyword classification of service requests,
  construction of service proportionality indices (expressed 311 demand
  vs. objective need from land use and physical conditions), engagement
  scoring, and spatial regression against demographic conditions to
  identify patterns of under- and over-reporting.
